& [CanonicalRecord: FSC4FinalSlices] is the processed planning authority for FSC4 final work slices
  + [canonical_uuid] is 68361ce3-a6da-4d8d-9acd-a9227d4f61d0
  + [source_manifest_uuid] is cf3c50d0-6360-441e-afaa-9895cc30ab44
  + [exploded_uuid] is 08d3b719-28b6-4f0b-b92b-bcdae889e6e7
  + [slice_surface_uuid] is a1235896-8c1c-45c9-ae56-3d6fe23fb9d6
  + [authority_scope] is FSC4 slice order, slice readiness, slice gates, model routing, expected outputs, and verification oracles
  + [implementation_scope] is final slice planning authority only
  + [depends_on] is docs/planning/FSC3_Runtime_Graph_Proof_Pack.v1.sop

  = must: use docs/slices/FSC4_Final_Slices.v1.sop as the current FSC4 slice surface
  = must: execute FSC4-S01 first
  = must: run completion review after each slice before opening the next gated slice
  = must: keep FSC5 work gated until FSC4-S07 accepts the surface projection pack
  = must: treat P8d local projection fixtures as an inside-FSC4 completion gate, not a prerequisite to minting FSC4 slices
  - never: treat FSC4 slice records as implementation proof

& [CanonicalFSC4SliceSet] is the final FSC4 slice sequence
  + [slice] is FSC4-S01 surface boundary and projection invariant map
  + [slice] is FSC4-S02 authority notice and projection record contract
  + [slice] is FSC4-S03 manager and worker projection contracts
  + [slice] is FSC4-S04 narrative and debug projection contracts
  + [slice] is FSC4-S05 conversation and adapter projection contracts
  + [slice] is FSC4-S06 surface projection fixture plan
  + [slice] is FSC4-S07 FSC4 completion review and activation packet

  = must: preserve this order unless completion review rebakes FSC4
  = must: mark downstream slices stale when an upstream accepted output changes

& [CanonicalFSC4ExecutionGate] is the activation rule for FSC4
  + [current_ready_slice] is FSC4-S01
  + [gated_slice] is FSC4-S02 until FSC4-S01 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is FSC4-S03 until FSC4-S02 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is FSC4-S04 until FSC4-S03 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is FSC4-S05 until FSC4-S04 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is FSC4-S06 until FSC4-S05 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is FSC4-S07 until FSC4-S06 accepted
  + [completion_gate] is FSC4 surface projection pack accepted after FSC4-S07

  = must: expose only FSC4-S01 as ready right now
  = must: keep all later slices gated inside FSC4

& [CanonicalFSC4ModelRouting] is the model-routing record
  + [FSC4-S01] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [FSC4-S02] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [FSC4-S03] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [FSC4-S04] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [FSC4-S05] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [FSC4-S06] is GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark-suitable after FSC4-S01 through FSC4-S05 are accepted
  + [FSC4-S07] is requires deeper reasoning

  = must: keep authority display, adapter mutation, and final surface pack acceptance under deeper reasoning
  = should: route projection fixture drafting to GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark only after projection contracts stabilize

